Dakkar 1.0 — 2026-10-21
=======================

- Dakkar's initial release under its own version number.
- Native GTK 3 file manager based on Nemo 6.4.5.
- Miller columns, customizable appearance and file-management features.
- Application executable: dakkar; desktop identifier: org.dakkar.Files.

For upstream project history and attribution, see ChangeLog, NOTICE and CREDITS.
